Thu Oct  1 01:50:07 2026 :: Log Alaric [2401]: say Repair works fine, now.
Thu Oct  1 01:50:40 2026 :: Log Alaric [2401]: say I'm skeptical to use smite since I noticed it will completely break a weapon, and I don't yet have an arsenal. Until BG farming
